{"path":"/ja/tip/08-27","title":"出張修理、車両点検、リフォームなどは、作業前に必ず価格を確認し、全工程を傍らで見守ること | HowToLiveBetter","description":"家電修理においては、料金基準を明示し、修理の証明書と領収書を発行しなければなりません。故障の虚偽報告や、正常に機能している部品の故意な交換は禁止されており、悪質な場合は3万元以下の罰金が科されます。すべての事業者は、明示された価格表示に従わなければならず、表示価格以外の追加料金を請求することはでき…","lang":"ja","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter ホーム","href":"/ja"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本を読む"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["厳選50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["今日のタスク"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["マイリスト"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["その他"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-tools"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-sound-toggle","aria-label":"効果音をオフ","aria-pressed":"true","title":"効果音をオフ"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-theme-trigger","aria-label":"システム","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-sun life-theme-icon-light","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 20v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-moon life-theme-icon-dark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-language-switch","aria-label":"日本語 言語を選ぶ","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-globe","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h20"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["日本語"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-account","href":"/ja/sign-in"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["ログイン"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/ja/book/08"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"目次に戻る"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["自分を犠牲にしないために：法律と財産の安全を守る"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"この章のヒント"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"交通事故に遭ったら、まずは停車、救護、通報。逃走してはいけない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"詐欺に気づいたら、すぐに 110 または 96110 に電話して支払停止を依頼すること。自分で調べるのは後回しに"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"詐欺防止の鉄則を覚えよう：電話を鵜呑みにしない、情報を明かさない、リンクをクリックしない、送金は必ず確認する。最も一般的な7つの詐欺はこのパターンです"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"ビデオで顔を見ること、電話で声を聞くことは「本人確認」とはみなさない。送金が絡む場合は一旦電話を切り、自分の連絡先に登録されている古い番号にかけ直すこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"容疑をかけられた、または召喚された場合は、まず弁護士を依頼すること。示談はせず、記録を削除しないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"問題が起きたら自ら説明しに行く：自首すれば刑期を最大4割減刑できる可能性があり、軽い犯罪ならさらに減刑や免罰もあり得る。「公訴時効を逃れる」という道は閉ざされている"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"飲酒した後はハンドルに触れない。電気自動車や「少しだけ動かす」場合も含む"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"銀行カード、SIMカード、決済アカウントを他人に貸さない。「資金洗浄（跑分）」は副業ではない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"年に2回、無料で自分の信用報告書をチェックし、身に覚えのないローンやカードがないか確認する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"衝突が起きたら、手を出さずにまず通報すること。先に手を出した側が、ほぼ確実に損をする"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"避けられない侵害に対しては反撃可能だが、現在手を出し続けている人物に対してのみ行うこと。相手が止まれば、あなたも止めること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"誰と恨みができたとしても（賃金未払い、解雇、金銭トラブルなど）―― 復讐ではなく、苦情申し立て、仲裁、訴訟の手続きを踏むこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"どれほど恨みがあっても無関係な人には手を出さない：車で群衆に突っ込む行為や公共の場での凶行は「危険な方法による公共の安全への危害罪」となり、刑期は3年から。死者が出れば10年以上、最高で死刑"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"「道連れにしてやる」「共倒れになってやる」といった考えが浮かんだら、緊急事態として対処：その場を離れ、車の鍵や刃物を他人に預け、12356 に電話する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"周囲の人が「誰も幸せになれないようにしてやる」「子供を連れて逃げる」と言い出した時、感情的な言葉だと思わないで：近親者は直接受診させることができ、警察は通報を受けたら必ず対応しなければなりません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"ネット上では誹謗中傷やデマ、未確認情報の拡散をしないこと。ネットリンチを受けた際は、まず証拠を残してから警察へ通報すること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"署名前に書類を最後まで読み、代理署名はせず、白紙には署名しない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"借金の際は借用書を明記すること。他人への保証人になる前には、代わりに返済する意思があるかよく考えること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"権利保護には期限があります：民事訴訟時効は 3 年、労働仲裁は 1 年、期限を過ぎると相手の「時効超過」の一言で十分です"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"提訴された、強制執行された場合は、財産を正直に報告し、支払える分だけ支払うこと。不動産や現金を親族や会社に移してはいけません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"消費制限または失信リストへの掲載を受けた場合は、まずどの条項に基づいて掲載されたのかを確認し、訂正可能な場合は訂正を申請すること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"ネットショッピングや中古取引で詐欺に遭ったら、まずはプラットフォームへ通報、次に警察へ通報、その上で訴訟を起こす価値があるかを検討"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"恋愛および婚姻における高額な贈与は、交付する前に慎重に検討を。交付後は原則として取り消せません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"結納金は振込で行い、用途を明記し、チャット履歴を保存すること。結婚を口実とした金銭要求は返還請求が可能"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"婚前財産を恐れる必要はありません。不動産の名義追加や親の出資は事前に明確に書き留めておくこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"結婚前に相手の婚姻状況を確認すること。結婚を口実にお金を騙し取る行為は詐欺罪として追及されます"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/08-27","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"出張修理、車両点検、リフォームなどは、作業前に必ず価格を確認し、全工程を傍らで見守ること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"「名義上の代表者」にならないこと。会社設立のために身分証を他人に貸さないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"出入国時に見知らぬ人の荷物を預からないこと。出所不明の小包を代理受領しないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"中国で犬を飼うなら必ずリードを使う。未装着の事故は無過失責任で賠償する。狂犬病ワクチンと飼育登録も忘れない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"相手が意識不明、睡眠中、または 14 歳未満である可能性がある場合は、性交渉を行わないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-32"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"性交渉やビデオチャットの後、相手が通報、写真の拡散、勤務先への連絡を盾に金銭を要求してきた場合、一銭も払わず、記録も削除せず、直ちに警察へ通報すること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-33"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"事実を捏造して通報された場合、以下の追及が可能です：治安行政処分に該当する場合は 5 日からの拘留、犯罪に該当する場合は 3 年以下の懲役"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-34"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"証拠不十分であれば本来無罪とされるべきであり、強要された自白は排除されるべきである。判決後には上訴や再審の道がある"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-35"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"勾留後に不起訴、不起訴処分または無罪判決を受けた場合、国家賠償を申請できます。賠償額は日割り計算されます"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-36"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"被害者として賠償を請求する場合、12315、訴訟、または弁護士を通じて行い、相手と二人きりで会う約束をしないこと。「金を払えば、公表しない」という言い方をセットにしないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-37"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"ネット炎上（ネットいじめ）に遭ったら：まずは防御設定、証拠保全、そしてプラットフォームへの通報・禁止命令・警察への通報の3つの道から選択"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-38"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"「保険をかけてから手を下す」という道は、法律上最初から完全に塞がれています：金銭は一切受け取れず、罪は殺人罪と保険詐欺罪の併合罪として処罰されます"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-39"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"警察への通報時はその場で受理票を受け取ること、不立案（事件化しない）の場合は書面での通知が必要：7 日以内に再審査を申請でき、さらに 7 日以内に再審査請求が可能。検察庁は警察に立案を通知できます"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-40"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"捜査・執行官への金銭やカードの贈賄は避けること：贈賄側も処罰の対象となり、監察・執行・司法関係者への贈賄はより重い刑が科される"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-41"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"トラブルに発展しそうな電話や面談は、直接録音する：自分が参加している会話なら、相手の事前の同意は不要"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-42"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"現場で事故が起きたら、まず全景、次に位置関係、最後に損傷と怪我の状況を撮影すること。元の写真や動画は削除しないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-43"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"ドメスティック・バイオレンス（DV）を受けた時：まずは警察に通報して出動記録を残し、その後に裁判所へ人身安全保護命令を申請しましょう。離婚を先に済ませる必要はなく、費用もかかりません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-44"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"家族がギャンブルで借金を作った場合、すぐに肩代わりして返済しないでください：ギャンブルの借金は法律で保護されず、ギャンブルのために借りたお金も夫婦の共同債務とはみなされません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-45"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["45"]},"知人から「顔認証の協力や証人になってほしい」と融資の手伝いを頼まれたら、決して応じてはいけない：これは「ABローン」と呼ばれ、借り手はあなたであり、保証人ではありません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-46"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["46"]},"ドアと窓に錠を付け、玄関外にセンサーライトを設置し、外出時は必ず施錠する。侵入窃盗の予防はこの組み合わせで、警報器だけの効果は認められない"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/08"},"children":["第8章"," ·"," ","自分を犠牲にしないために：法律と財産の安全を守る"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"08-27"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["27"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["出張修理、車両点検、リフォームなどは、作業前に必ず価格を確認し、全工程を傍らで見守ること"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["家電修理においては、料金基準を明示し、修理の証明書と領収書を発行しなければなりません。故障の虚偽報告や、正常に機能している部品の故意な交換は禁止されており、悪質な場合は3万元以下の罰金が科されます。すべての事業者は、明示された価格表示に従わなければならず、表示価格以外の追加料金を請求することはできません。したがって、作業を開始する前に、料金と交換部品を明確に確認し、修理後は証明書と領収書を受け取り、古い部品は保管しておいてください。多く請求された場合は、まず12315に連絡してください。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。作業を開始する前に、料金基準と交換が必要な部品を明確に確認し、見積もりを写真に撮るか、相手にテキ…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["家電修理事業者は、サービス項目、部品の料金基準、品質規格、保証期間、および苦情窓口の電話番号を明示しなければなりません。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：出張修理、車両点検、リフォームなどは、作業前に必ず価格を確認し、全工程を傍らで見守ること"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。作業を開始する前に、料金基準と交換が必要な部品を明確に確認し、見積もりを写真に撮るか、相手にテキストで送らせてください。修理後は修理証明書と領収書を受け取り、古い部品は手元に残してください。また、1〜2時間は傍らで見ておく必要があります。難しいのは、全工程を離れずに監視し続けることです。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["家電修理事業者は、サービス項目、部品の料金基準、品質規格、保証期間、および苦情窓口の電話番号を明示しなければなりません。消費者に対し、修理サービスの証明書と料金領収書を発行し、修理項目と詳細を正確に記載しなければなりません。修理項目の虚偽、誇張、偽造、故障部品の虚偽報告、および正常な部品の故意な交換は禁止されています。悪質な場合は、3万元以下の罰金が科されます。すべての事業者は、価格を明示しなければならず、表示価格以外の追加料金や、明記されていない費用の徴収は禁止されています。低価格で誘い込み、高額で決済する行為、および虚偽の割引は、価格詐欺に該当します。事業者は、サービスの内容、項目、価格、および計算方法を顕著な方法で明示しなければならず、虚偽または誤解を招く宣伝を行ってはなりません（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["商务部 (2012). 家电维修服务业管理办法（商务部令 2012 年第 7 号，第五、七、九、十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2012/content_2231695.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2012/content_2231695.htm"]},"；市场监管总局 (2022). 明码标价和禁止价格欺诈规定（市场监管总局令第 56 号，第五、八、十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2022/content_5699926.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2022/content_5699926.htm"]},"；国务院 (2024). 消费者权益保护法实施条例（国务院令第 778 号，第九、十条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202403/content_6940159.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202403/content_6940159.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2013 修正). 消费者权益保护法（第八、十条）：「消费者有权根据商品或者服务的不同情况，要求经营者提供……服务的内容、规格、费用等有关情况」「有权拒绝经营者的强制交易行为」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7670606ef","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7670606ef"]},"（国家法律法规数据库）"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2012/content_2231695.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["多く請求された場合は、まず12315に連絡してください。処罰は商務・市場監督部門が行うため、自分で訴訟を起こす必要はありません。B級とした理由は、ルールは公的なものですが、「傍らで見守ることでどれだけ支出を抑えられるか」については具体的な数字がなく、主に経験に依存するためです。価格の確認、証明書の保管、古い部品の保管は、誰に対しても同様に行うべきであり、相手の外見で判断する必要はありません。家電に関する方法は家電修理にのみ適用されますが、車両点検やリフォームについては、価格表示規定および実施条例を参考にしてください。上位の消費者権利保護法にも、これら二つの権利が記載されています。第八条では、事業者にサービスの内容、規格、費用について説明を求める権利があるとされており、第十条では、強制的な取引を拒否する権利があるとされています。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/08-26"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"結婚前に相手の婚姻状況を確認すること。結婚を口実にお金を騙し取る行為は詐欺罪として追及されます"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/08-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"「名義上の代表者」にならないこと。会社設立のために身分証を他人に貸さないこと"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-23"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["恋愛および婚姻における高額な贈与は、交付する前に慎重に検討を。交付後は原則として取り消せません"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一度お金を渡してしまうと、原則として取り戻すことはできません。贈与したものは、相手の名義に移る前であれば自由に撤回できます。名義変更が完了…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-24"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["結納金は振込で行い、用途を明記し、チャット履歴を保存すること。結婚を口実とした金銭要求は返還請求が可能"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["結婚を口実とした財産の要求は法律で禁止されており、裁判所は返還を支持します。婚姻届を出していない場合、届出はしているが実態として共同生活が…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-25"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["婚前財産を恐れる必要はありません。不動産の名義追加や親の出資は事前に明確に書き留めておくこと"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["婚前の財産はあなた個人のものであり、結婚期間が長いからといって共有財産になることはありません。夫婦間で、婚前および婚後の財産がそれぞれ個人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-29"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出入国時に見知らぬ人の荷物を預からないこと。出所不明の小包を代理受領しないこと"]},{"t